			"height": 188,
			"weight": 160,
			"backgroundStory": "Qin Yuanhao never had to work for anyone's attention. A slight smile and a few words usually did the job for him, right alongside a sword arm most disciples twice his training spent years chasing. He grew up looking after his younger sister more than anyone looked after him, and it left a habit he never shook: soft-spoken with children, sharp-eyed for anyone who might hurt one.\r\n\r\nWhen his sect fell, he made it out; he was calm even then, the kind of calm that worries people more than panic would. His sister made it out too, though they were separated in the chaos, and he's been tracing rumors of her ever since. He'll find her. He's just decided panicking wouldn't get him there any faster.",
			"refuseText": "Sorry, we can't help you...",
			"acceptText": "We'll help you find her.",
